 "_comment": "Every sound and piece of music the game plays. sounds: files (one picked at random each time), bus (sfx, voice, music, ambience, ui), volume 0..1, range (tiles beyond the area around the centre of the screen at which it has faded to half: big guns carry further), priority (who gets a voice when all are busy), reverb (send to the hall, 0..1; distance adds more), pitch (random variation, +/- fraction), perSecond and limit (at most this many starts a second and this many playing at once), loop. Weapons name their firing and impact sounds in rules/weapons.json. music: playlists by mood; volume per track. ambience: a loop per biome under everything, and 'battle', the far-off front heard when the fighting is away from the camera. A mod can replace any file by putting one at the same path in its own audio folder.",
